sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.leave.index)"
    participant Controller as "LeaveRequestController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Klik Export (excel/csv/pdf)
    View->>Controller: GET /leaves/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: Bangun query filter export
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_requests + relasi sesuai filter
    DB-->>Model: Dataset export
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap diekspor

    alt Data valid (dataset tersedia)
        Controller->>View: Return file export (xlsx/csv/pdf)
        View-->>Admin: File unduhan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (query gagal/format tidak valid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal export data cuti
    end
